*& CORRECTED item-row logic for ZSCWM_WO_PICKSHEET  (BA-4030)
*&
*& ROOT CAUSE (confirmed in debugger):
*&   /SCWM/ORDIM_O-RDOCID and -RITMID are INITIAL (all-zero GUID) for
*&   these HU/stock-driven picks (FLGHUTO=X, ProcType 2010 PICK).
*&   => the RITMID = ITEMID delivery-item join cannot match.
*&
*& FIX:
*&   Material + Description come from the WT's own MATID, not the OD item.
*&     ORDIM_O-MATID -> /SAPAPO/MATKEY-MATID  get MATNR  (Material)
*&     ORDIM_O-MATID -> /SAPAPO/MATTXT-MATID  get MAKTX  (Description)
*&   Keep the OD-item read only as a FALLBACK for when RITMID is filled
*&   (delivery-driven WTs), so both task types are covered.
